heretek-homeworld-death-name = Death World
heretek-homeworld-death-description = A brutal planet where its flora, fauna, and the environment itself are hostile to human life. Its survivors are resilient and used to constant danger.
heretek-homeworld-death-lore-note = On death worlds, survival is a daily discipline: people learn to read predators, poisons, and weather before they learn to trust a stranger.
heretek-homeworld-death-feature-name = Survival Instinct
heretek-homeworld-death-feature-description = When severely wounded, it will later grant temporary resilience, protection, and a chance to dodge.
heretek-homeworld-death-talents = Brutal Hunter, Trusty Weapons, Wounded Beast, Tenacity, Lifetime of Scars.

heretek-homeworld-voidborn-name = Voidborn
heretek-homeworld-voidborn-description = A native of ships and orbital stations, adapted to life beyond a planet and the dangers of zero gravity.
heretek-homeworld-voidborn-lore-note = Voidborn spend their lives among decks and engine spaces; narrow corridors, emergency rites, and the starry void are more familiar than an open sky.
heretek-homeworld-voidborn-feature-name = Fortune
heretek-homeworld-voidborn-feature-description = It will later offer a chance to turn failure into another attempt; enemies will find it harder to dodge or parry the character's actions.
heretek-homeworld-voidborn-talents = Bloody Mess, Contagious Luck, Just a Flesh Wound, Jinx, Be Smart.

heretek-homeworld-hive-name = Hive World
heretek-homeworld-hive-description = An endless hive city where immense populations sustain the economy and war machine of the Imperium.
heretek-homeworld-hive-lore-note = A hive climbs and descends through thousands of levels. Its inhabitants learn early the value of rumours, connections, and a safe route through another sector.
heretek-homeworld-hive-feature-name = Strength in Numbers
heretek-homeworld-hive-feature-description = It will later raise Resolve around allies and reduce it in isolation.
heretek-homeworld-hive-talents = Comradery, Outnumber, Weapon Personalisation, Helping Hand, Fresh Start.

heretek-homeworld-forge-name = Forge World
heretek-homeworld-forge-description = An industrial domain of the Adeptus Mechanicus, where life serves production, knowledge, and the machine.
heretek-homeworld-forge-lore-note = On a forge world, shift bells and Mechanicus litanies set the rhythm of whole cities. Knowledge of a mechanism is valued above lineage.
heretek-homeworld-forge-feature-name = Made for a Purpose
heretek-homeworld-forge-feature-description = It will later allow one cybernetic upgrade: subdermal armour, a locomotion system, or an analytical system.
heretek-homeworld-forge-talents = Pinnacle of Weaponry, Fires of the Forge, Steel of the Forge, Persistence, Calculated Relations.

heretek-homeworld-imperial-name = Imperial World
heretek-homeworld-imperial-description = An ordinary populated world of the Imperium, whose people make up the bulk of its servants, soldiers, and colonists.
heretek-homeworld-imperial-lore-note = Imperial worlds live under the steady rule of the Adeptus Terra. Education, service, and a place in the local community often decide a person's fate.
heretek-homeworld-imperial-feature-name = The Best of Humanity
heretek-homeworld-imperial-feature-description = It will later grant +10 to one chosen characteristic; Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill are excluded.
heretek-homeworld-imperial-talents = Ready to Serve, Better to Die for the Emperor, Doing My Part, Know No Heresy, Stronger Together.

heretek-homeworld-fortress-name = Fortress World
heretek-homeworld-fortress-description = A planet devoted entirely to defence, where its people are raised for military discipline and unending war.
heretek-homeworld-fortress-lore-note = On a fortress world, drills, watch rotations, and defensive lines govern daily life. Even peaceful trades serve one purpose: holding the next assault.
heretek-homeworld-fortress-feature-name = Never Stop Shooting
heretek-homeworld-fortress-feature-description = Successful kills will later build combat momentum that can be turned into an extra action.
heretek-homeworld-fortress-talents = Hail of Steel, Familiar Kickback, Spare Magazine, Never Stop Believing.

heretek-onboarding-origin-list-title = Choose an origin
heretek-onboarding-origin-modifiers-title = Modifiers
heretek-onboarding-origin-focus-title = Focus
heretek-onboarding-origin-lore-title = Lore note

heretek-origin-commander-name = Astra Militarum Commander
heretek-origin-commander-description = A former Imperial Guard regimental commander, used to leading many soldiers and coordinating fire support.
heretek-origin-commander-feature-name = Regimental Tactics
heretek-origin-commander-focus-description = Regimental Tactics bring orders, priority targets, and fire support together into a single coordinated strike.
heretek-origin-commander-lore-note = Astra Militarum commanders lead regiments whose strength rests on supply, formation, and trust in orders. Personal example is part of their military doctrine.
heretek-origin-commander-talents = Suppression Fire!, Field of Fire, Fix Bayonets!, Unflinching Heroism, Trench Warfare.

heretek-origin-commissar-name = Commissar
heretek-origin-commissar-description = A political officer of the Astra Militarum who maintains discipline and morale through fear, authority, and personal courage.
heretek-origin-commissar-feature-name = At All Costs!
heretek-origin-commissar-focus-description = Iron discipline and personal courage keep the line from breaking, even when the order demands a dangerous sacrifice.
heretek-origin-commissar-lore-note = Commissars of the Officio Prefectus oversee the morale and loyalty of Imperial regiments. To their troops, they are judge, example of courage, and final warning at once.
heretek-origin-commissar-talents = One for the Enemies, Two for the Traitors, Let Them Know Fear!, Motivation, Summary Execution, For the Emperor!.

heretek-origin-crime-lord-name = Crime Lord
heretek-origin-crime-lord-description = A cunning former criminal authority who survives through prepared plans, calculation, and exploiting an enemy's weaknesses.
heretek-origin-crime-lord-feature-name = Sure-Fire Plan
heretek-origin-crime-lord-focus-description = A prepared plan turns dirty tricks, a retreat, and a sudden strike into a calculated advantage.
heretek-origin-crime-lord-lore-note = Imperial criminal syndicates live by bargains, debts, and hidden routes. Their former lords are used to keeping an escape route for every alliance.
heretek-origin-crime-lord-talents = Killing Plan, Escape Plan, Disorienting Plan, Contingency Plan, The Last Plan.

heretek-origin-priest-name = Ministorum Priest
heretek-origin-priest-description = A high-ranking preacher of the Adeptus Ministorum, turning faith in the Emperor into fanaticism and resilience in their flock.
heretek-origin-priest-feature-name = War Hymn
heretek-origin-priest-focus-description = A War Hymn turns faith into the rhythm of battle, supporting allies' resolve and wrath against the Imperium's enemies.
heretek-origin-priest-lore-note = Ministorum preachers carry the cult of the God-Emperor into garrisons, shrines, and battlefields. Their words must steady the faithful before the guns begin to speak.
heretek-origin-priest-talents = Litany of Purification, Litany of Hatred, Tenets of Retribution, The Emperor Protects, Flensing Faith.

heretek-origin-navy-name = Imperial Navy Officer
heretek-origin-navy-description = A battle-hardened voidship commander for whom protecting the crew and directing combat in confined spaces are familiar duties.
heretek-origin-navy-feature-name = Brace for Impact!
heretek-origin-navy-focus-description = "Brace for Impact!" gathers a crew before a barrage, boarding action, or accident and makes defence a shared duty.
heretek-origin-navy-lore-note = Imperial Navy officers spend years between the deck, bridge, and void combat. They know that one mistaken order can cost a ship its entire crew.
heretek-origin-navy-talents = Stentorian Voice, Evasive Manoeuvres, Fleet Combat Training, Get off Me!, Get Into Cover!.

heretek-origin-noble-name = Noble
heretek-origin-noble-description = A member of the privileged elite of the Imperium, raised amid wealth, authority, and the unquestioning obedience of servants.
heretek-origin-noble-feature-name = You. Serve Me.
heretek-origin-noble-focus-description = Orders, connections, and a sense of rank let a noble quickly assign roles and use the opportunities of their retinue.
heretek-origin-noble-lore-note = Imperial nobility rules houses, estates, and whole worlds in Terra's name. From childhood, a noble learns authority, etiquette, and the price of a servant's loyalty.
heretek-origin-noble-talents = You. Do Something., You. Protect Me., You. Go On., You. Kill It., You. You Are Next.

heretek-origin-psyker-name = Sanctioned Psyker
heretek-origin-psyker-description = A human trained and sanctioned by the Adeptus Astra Telepathica to use the powers of the Warp more safely in service to the Imperium.
heretek-origin-psyker-feature-name = Psychic powers
heretek-origin-psyker-focus-description = Psychic powers channel the Warp through discipline, training, and constant control over the danger of a psychic collapse.
heretek-origin-psyker-lore-note = The Adeptus Astra Telepathica trains sanctioned psykers and admits them to service only after harsh trials. Even a useful psyker remains feared and closely watched.
heretek-origin-psyker-talents = Still Mind, Subtle Manipulation, Second Sight, Obscured Threat, Psyker Minoris, Psyker Majoris, Psyker Terminus, Psyker Extremis.

heretek-origin-arbitrator-name = Arbitrator
heretek-origin-arbitrator-description = An Adeptus Arbites officer and executor of the Lex Imperialis, the laws of the Imperium. This origin will later branch into one of three specializations.
heretek-origin-arbitrator-feature-name = Lex Imperialis
heretek-origin-arbitrator-focus-description = Imperial law demands observation, rapid suppression of a threat, and readiness to carry out its sentence.
heretek-origin-arbitrator-lore-note = The Adeptus Arbites enforces not local custom but the higher Lex Imperialis. An Arbitrator brings order to the Imperium's fringes regardless of a planetary ruler's will.
heretek-origin-arbitrator-talents = General and specialized talents will arrive with the Arbitrator ability system.

