heretek-background-triumph-apex = Apex of Brilliance
heretek-background-triumph-feat = Feat of Greatness
heretek-background-triumph-glory = Illustrious Glory
heretek-background-darkest-brand = Brand of Shame
heretek-background-darkest-portents = Grim Portents
heretek-background-darkest-torment = Shadow of Torment

heretek-background-commander-apex = Through reform and personal command, you restored a broken regiment's martial glory.
heretek-background-commander-feat = In a hopeless campaign, you led the remnants of your regiment from encirclement and held the evacuation route.
heretek-background-commander-glory = You and your guardsmen defended a shrine world and received a high honour.
heretek-background-commander-brand = As supreme commander of a failed campaign, you were buried beneath disgrace.
heretek-background-commander-portents = Since the regiment died, dreams have pursued you with an order that cannot be revoked.
heretek-background-commander-torment = Captured during a retreat, you endured the enemy's interrogations and returned a different person.

heretek-background-commissar-apex = You uncovered a conspiracy among senior Astra Militarum officers.
heretek-background-commissar-feat = At the decisive hour, you rallied a wavering garrison and led it into a counterattack.
heretek-background-commissar-glory = Your name became a symbol of loyalty and valour, and your face appeared on propaganda posters.
heretek-background-commissar-brand = Falsely accused of cowardice, you endured a humiliating tribunal.
heretek-background-commissar-portents = In nightmares, you still hear the names of those executed by your order.
heretek-background-commissar-torment = Heretics captured you and tried to break your faith and duty.

heretek-background-crime-lord-apex = You subjugated an entire star system and turned it into a private den of thieves.
heretek-background-crime-lord-feat = You survived a syndicate war by turning enemy plans against their authors.
heretek-background-crime-lord-glory = You stole a priceless treasure from an Ecclesiarchy cardinal's guarded sanctuary.
heretek-background-crime-lord-brand = You gave your partners to the authorities and became known as a traitor.
heretek-background-crime-lord-portents = A bargain with forces you did not understand still visits you in dreams.
heretek-background-crime-lord-torment = Enforcers held you in their cells for a long time, trying to extract names and accounts.

heretek-background-priest-apex = By destroying the foundation of heretical teaching, you overthrew a dangerous schismatic sect.
heretek-background-priest-feat = You held your flock in a besieged sanctuary when hope had already faded.
heretek-background-priest-glory = You were recognised as a worthy successor to a high-ranking Ecclesiarchy hierarch.
heretek-background-priest-brand = You renounced your mentor and testified against them in an Ecclesiarchy court.
heretek-background-priest-portents = Visions of faith falling do not leave you in peace.
heretek-background-priest-torment = Enemies of the Imperium tortured you, seeking to turn prayer into despair.

heretek-background-navy-apex = You lured a pirate squadron into a star's gravity rift and destroyed the fleet through a single stratagem.
heretek-background-navy-feat = You guided a convoy through fire and the Warp, preserving ships and crews.
heretek-background-navy-glory = Your ship was the first to traverse a restored route to a cluster of lost worlds of Humanity.
heretek-background-navy-brand = After the loss of a ship, you were judged a reckless commander.
heretek-background-navy-portents = Dreams of the soundless Warp warn you of another catastrophe.
heretek-background-navy-torment = Pirates captured you for navigation codes and left the marks of their interrogations.

heretek-background-noble-apex = Your presence and persuasion stopped a feudal war between neighbouring systems.
heretek-background-noble-feat = You survived a palace coup and saved your house, though the price of victory was high.
heretek-background-noble-glory = You were appointed planetary governor and survived by making useful ties on both sides of the law.
heretek-background-noble-brand = A scandal deprived your house of influence and you of your former glory.
heretek-background-noble-portents = A prediction of your house's fall turned every success into a new warning.
heretek-background-noble-torment = Rebels held you captive to make you a symbol of broken authority.

heretek-background-psyker-apex = By unraveling a potent psychically active xenos artefact, you destroyed a creation of Humanity's enemies.
heretek-background-psyker-feat = You held a Warp rift long enough to save those caught nearby.
heretek-background-psyker-glory = Alone, you saved a pilgrim ship by stopping a Warp breach in the Immaterium.
heretek-background-psyker-brand = A psychic breakdown wounded allies and left you marked as dangerous.
heretek-background-psyker-portents = The Warp whispers of the future in voices that make you fear sleep.
heretek-background-psyker-torment = On a Black Ship, trials broke you down while trying to measure the limit of your will.

heretek-background-arbitrator-apex = You preserved a copy of regional Lex and extracted an unprecedented tithe from a rebellious Imperial world.
heretek-background-arbitrator-feat = You suppressed an uprising without letting it shatter enforcement of the Lex Imperialis.
heretek-background-arbitrator-glory = With words alone, you convinced rebels to join the Arbitrators during a planetary revolt.
heretek-background-arbitrator-brand = Collectors deceived you during a tithe delivery, and you could not prove your innocence.
heretek-background-arbitrator-portents = Evidence from an old case returns in dreams and foretells another failure of the law.
heretek-background-arbitrator-torment = Pirates kidnapped you for tithe transport routes; you survived, but never recovered from the torture.

