heretek-characteristic-melee-description = Determines the character's effectiveness in hand-to-hand combat.
heretek-characteristic-melee-navigation-description = Melee effectiveness.
heretek-characteristic-melee-effect = Each point increases damage from any melee weapon by 1% and reduces the delay between melee attacks by 0.5% of its current value. Delay reduction is capped at 50%.

heretek-characteristic-ranged-name = Ranged combat
heretek-characteristic-ranged-description = Determines the character's accuracy with ranged weapons.
heretek-characteristic-ranged-navigation-description = Ranged accuracy.
heretek-characteristic-ranged-effect = Each point increases ranged weapon damage by 1% and reduces bullet spread and recoil by 0.5% of their current values. Spread and recoil reduction are capped at 50%.

heretek-characteristic-endurance-name = Endurance
heretek-characteristic-endurance-description = Determines reserves of strength and the ability to survive damage.
heretek-characteristic-endurance-navigation-description = Stamina and resilience.
heretek-characteristic-endurance-effect = Each point grants +1 maximum health and +1 maximum stamina, and shifts the critical-state threshold by 1.

heretek-characteristic-intelligence-name = Intelligence
heretek-characteristic-intelligence-description = Determines the speed and confidence of work with complex objects and systems.
heretek-characteristic-intelligence-navigation-description = Complex systems work.
heretek-characteristic-intelligence-effect = Each point speeds up any DoAfter action by 1%.

heretek-characteristic-agility-name = Agility
heretek-characteristic-agility-description = Determines mobility and the ability to change position quickly.
heretek-characteristic-agility-navigation-description = Mobility and maneuvers.
heretek-characteristic-agility-effect = Each point increases movement speed by 1%, up to a 25% bonus. At 25 points, dodge becomes available; maximum dodges increase by 1 for every full 25 points.

